    "insights": [
      "density_consecutive_bound is FALSE: {23,28} in [23,29) are both obstructed (23=4^0*(8*2+7), 28=4^1*7)",
      "three_sq_subroutine_correctness is definitionally trivial: IsSumOfThreeSquares m = \u2203 a b c, a^2+b^2+c^2=m, so obtain suffices",
      "valid_splitter_exists uses Nat.sum_four_squares: any Lagrange decomposition n=a^2+b^2+c^2+d^2 gives x=d as valid splitter",
      "density_limit_one_sixth: excluded forms have density 1/6 via tsum_geometric_of_lt_one (geometric series (1/8)/(1-1/4)=1/6)",
      "obstructed_iff_base_or_step: self-similar recurrence enables structural induction on excluded forms"
